# Shell script safety

Quote variables and command substitutions. Do not parse ls output.

Match existing errexit/nounset/pipefail usage when the file or shebang
already enables them. Do not silently disable shellcheck directives.

Prefer POSIX sh for hooks; use bash only when the repo already does.
